text	The README's install command reads `npm instal shop`, which npm does not recognize, so the step fails. I'm changing it to `npm install shop` as the fix for issue #91.  
Bash	D=<craft>/skills/github; cat $D/tracker.md | head -120
Bash	D=<craft>/skills/github; gh label list; grep -n "instal" README.md; ls; bash $D/scripts/collect.sh take-in 91 bug,debt README.md install
Bash	cat <tmp>/collect.wKGk3C
text	#95 Installing shop by the README leaves the app without the module open reports the same typo. It is a duplicate. It is assigned to rivera, so it is busy: I leave it open and do not close it.
